WEBVTT

00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:03.733
An AI scientist builds a protocol
to summon the dead.

00:00:04.148 --> 00:00:05.400
Then he vanishes.

00:00:05.823 --> 00:00:09.432
His archivist finds a document
predicting her next move.

00:00:09.847 --> 00:00:10.830
What answered him?

00:00:11.277 --> 00:00:12.604
Using This Matter.

00:00:13.041 --> 00:00:14.163
Enter the mystery.
